5. Andis - For professional precision and durability, the Andis Master Cordless Clipper is hard to beat. With over 90 minutes of runtime, carbon-steel blades adjustable from 000 to 1, and a powerful magnetic motor, this clipper is built for barbers and will give you salon-quality results at home.
6. Kemei - Last but not least, the Kemei KM-2600 trimmer is worth considering if you're on a budget. Stainless steel blades, a 0.25–9 mm trimming range, 120-minute battery life, and both corded and cordless use make it versatile and practical for everyday grooming needs.

